	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"Welcome to the Tetra tutorial series！If this quest cannot be submitted properly, it is most likely because you have selected &dQuick Mode&r. In Quick Mode, this quest will not be hidden."
				""
				"You may have already noticed that this modpack does not include convenience mods such as vein mining. The reason is similar to the relationship between TPA and teleport stones—wherever immersion can be enhanced through mods, it should not be replaced by overly direct mechanics."
				""
				"Tetra allows you to &eslightly freely&r (to some extent) modify your tools, giving you a tool assembly experience similar to &dTinkers’ Construct&r. In addition, various &6Ancient Schematics&r enable you to craft ancient components, granting powerful effects such as 3×3 mining."
				""
				"Mastering Tetra can significantly improve both your efficiency in combat and resource gathering. Since its progression is not overly complex, it is strongly recommended to explore Tetra early in your journey."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1b
				id: "tetra:modular_double"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
					"double/basic_hammer_left_material": "basic_hammer/oak"
					"double/basic_hammer_right_material": "basic_hammer/oak"
					"double/basic_handle_material": "basic_handle/stick"
					"double/handle": "double/basic_handle"
					"double/head_left": "double/basic_hammer_left"
					"double/head_right": "double/basic_hammer_right"
					id: "939840db-7443-43fc-a98c-3ef255263d48"
				}
			}
