		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6DCBC9E0C68FCAB4"]
			description: [
				"Double-headed tools are known for their two head sections, which enable a wide range of functionality."
				""
				"The hammer serves as the foundational modification tool, and its upgrades are a core progression element throughout Tetra."
				""
				"For a pickaxe-type tool, large-scale excavation becomes an important option. Installing the &6Chthonic Extractor&r which obtained from &cForge ruins&r on the right head section grants a &e3×3 mining area&r. (Any double-headed tool can equip this component to gain this ability.)"
				""
				"Axe-pick combinations: replacing one of the head sections with an &eaxe or hand axe&r results in a &emulti-purpose mining tool&r."
				""
				"To open crates or forging containers found in ruins, you need a tool with a claw hammer-like function, which provides the ability to &epry objects open&r."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: {
				Count: 1b
				id: "tetra:modular_double"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
					"double/basic_hammer_left_material": "basic_hammer/oak"
