		{
			dependencies: ["6DCBC9E0C68FCAB4"]
			description: [
				"Modifying a single-head tool’s head into a &6Walking Cane&r grants a mobility bonus, holding it increases your movement speed."
				""
				"Changing the handle to a &6Light Handle&r gives the tool a &athrowable property&r. When combined with the &aLoyalty enchantment&r, it can function similarly to a trident."
				""
				"If the head is instead modified into a &6Earthpiercer&r, it gains the ability to &ebreak blocks at range&r."
				""
				"Switching the handle to a &6Long Handle&r provides extended reach, allowing you to interact with objects from a greater distance."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
