		{
			dependencies: ["312A09022249980F"]
			description: [
				"Modifying traditional weapons can grant them new attack properties or even tool-like functionality."
				""
				"Some of these new combat characteristics may help players rediscover their appreciation for certain weapons and inspire new approaches to gameplay."
				""
				"This section will briefly outline possible &emodification directions&r for various weapons, providing players with ideas and inspiration for customization."
