		{
			dependencies: ["7E7580FC10C7CB80"]
			description: [
				"Install a &6Quick Latch&r on the bow to turn it into an &eautomatic firing mode&r."
				""
				"Modify the &6Scope&r to zoom in while holding Shift, and combine it with &ehigh-damage upgrades&r to enable &asniping capabilities&r."
				""
				"Using different materials for the &6Arrow Extension rest&r grants the bow &ascatter shooting&r. Using &6Screws&r as the material allows you to adjust both the number of arrows fired and the spread angle."
				""
				"The &6Planar Stabilizer&r can &eminimize ballistic deviation&r, making your arrows &esignificantly more accurate&r."
