			description: [
				"Rope can be modified to store items or transformed into mobility tools."
				""
				"&cPortable Storage&r: Use various storage upgrades to allow the belt to &estore potions, arrows, and other items&r."
				""
				"&cLevitation&r: With a Planar Stabilizer upgrade, within the range of an activated Beacon, pressing the jump key mid-air allows &eindefinite hovering&r."
				""
				"&cDash&r: Install boosters to gain abilities similar to rocket boots, enabling &erapid bursts of movement and dashing&r."
			]
