			description: [
				"&dThe default Forging Hammer is equivalent to a Tier 5 Hammer.&r"
				""
				"The Forging Hammer requires two &6Thermal Cells&r (square slots) installed on the sides to function properly, along with two &ePlugins&r (rectangular slots). A &6Forged Workbench&r must also be placed one block directly below it, leaving a one-block air gap."
