				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"After the Forging Hammer completes a cycle, there is a chance it may malfunction and become jammed. To fix it, you must hold a &eTier 4 or higher Hammer&r and &eright-click the lower edge of the hammer head&r to repair it."
				""
				"{image:kubejs:textures/task/tetra_5.png width:190 height:107 align:1}"
